--- answer ---
Added `PeekWithExpiry` after `Peek` in expirable/expirable_lru.go:214 — it mirrors `Peek`'s lock/expiry logic but also returns `ent.ExpiresAt`, giving zero value, zero time and `false` for missing or expired entries. Added `TestLRUPeekWithExpiry` in expirable/expirable_lru_test.go covering hit, miss, and expired cases; `go build`, `go vet`, and the full `expirable` test suite all pass.